      "cooked": "<p>Last night I opened the SotM app (iPad) for the first time in a few weeks, asked for a random setup, and was surprised to have a couple of Earth-Prime variants show up in my random lineup, even though I hadn’t unlocked them.  Hmmm…</p>\n<p>Oddly, when I open the SoEP app, none of the variants are unlocked there (even though I’m pretty sure I unlocked one or two of them; maybe by playing in the SotM app?).  Very strange that one is fully unlocked but the other isn’t.</p>\n<p>Either way, I need to get back in and work on unlocking them properly!</p>",
